   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2023-05-09",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Appropriation (Parliamentary Departments) Bill (No. 1) 2023-2024 seeks over $314 million from the Consolidated Revenue Fund, including $250 million for the Department of Parliamentary Services to address accommodation pressures and ICT services, and a $1.9 million advance to the responsible Presiding Officer."
  }
